---
// Footer.astro - Claude Code Changelog Viewer Footer Component
---

<footer class='mt-24'>
  <div
    class='max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 border-t border-[hsl(var(--cc-gray))]'
  >
    <!-- AI生成コンテンツの注意書き -->
    <div
      class='mb-8 p-6 bg-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange)/0.05)] border-l-4 border-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] rounded-r-lg'
    >
      <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
        <svg
          class='w-6 h-6 text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] shrink-0 mt-0.5'
          fill='none'
          viewBox='0 0 24 24'
          stroke='currentColor'
          stroke-width='2'
          aria-hidden='true'
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap='round'
            stroke-linejoin='round'
            d='M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z'
          ></path>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p
            class='text-sm font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black))] mb-1'
          >
            AI生成コンテンツについて
          </p>
          <p
            class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.8)] leading-relaxed'
          >
            ページの概要(サマリー)、変更内容の日本語訳、ユーザーへの恩恵の解説はAIによって生成されているため、誤っている可能性があります。正確な情報は
            <a
              href='https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-orange-hover))] underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors'
            >
              公式リリースノート
            </a>
            をご確認ください。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8'>
      <div>
        <p
          class='text-sm font-bold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black))] mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase'
        >
          リソース
        </p>
        <ul class='space-y-3'>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 group'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform'
                fill='currentColor'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule='evenodd'
                  d='M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z'
                  clip-rule='evenodd'></path>
              </svg>
              Claude Code GitHub
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://code.claude.com/docs'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 group'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              公式ドキュメント
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p
          class='text-sm font-bold text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black))] mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase'
        >
          プロジェクト
        </p>
        <ul class='space-y-3'>
          <li>
            <a
              href='https://github.com/Suntory-N-Water/claude-code-changelog-viewer'
              target='_blank'
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 group'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform'
                fill='currentColor'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  fill-rule='evenodd'
                  d='M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z'
                  clip-rule='evenodd'></path>
              </svg>
              GitHubリポジトリ
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href='/notify'
              class='text-sm text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.7)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 group'
            >
              <svg
                class='w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform'
                fill='none'
                viewBox='0 0 24 24'
                stroke='currentColor'
                stroke-width='2'
                aria-hidden='true'
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap='round'
                  stroke-linejoin='round'
                  d='M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9'
                ></path>
              </svg>
              Discord通知
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class='pt-8 border-t border-[hsl(var(--cc-gray))] flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2'
    >
      <p class='text-xs text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.5)]'>
        非公式プロジェクト。AnthropicおよびClaudeはAnthropic, PBCの商標です。
      </p>
      <a
        href='/privacy'
        class='text-xs text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-black)/0.5)] hover:text-[hsl(var(--cc-main-orange))] transition-colors'
      >
        プライバシーポリシー
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
